                  </td>
                  <td style="padding:12px;border:1px solid #5a76a3;">
                    Recognizes individual differences
                  </td>
                  <td style="padding:12px;border:1px solid #5a76a3;">
                    "Does everyone there follow that tradition?"
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:12px;border:1px solid #5a76a3;">
                    "What's something outsiders often misunderstand about your country?"
                  </td>
                  <td style="padding:12px;border:1px solid #5a76a3;">
                    Lets the person correct stereotypes
                  </td>
                  <td style="padding:12px;border:1px solid #5a76a3;">
                    "Is it true that people there are all like X?"
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:12px;border:1px solid #5a76a3;">
                    "What music do you enjoy?"
                  </td>
                  <td style="padding:12px;border:1px solid #5a76a3;">
                    Starts with an easy personal interest
                  </td>
                  <td style="padding:12px;border:1px solid #5a76a3;">
                    Questions about sensitive personal information
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
